<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - FAI repays A$79.2 mln of Swiss debt.</title>
<headline>RTRS - FAI repays A$79.2 mln of Swiss debt.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>FAI Insurances Ltd said on Thursday on November 18 the company had repaid borrowings of 78.9 million Swiss francs, equivalent to A$79.2 million.  </p>
<p>FAI said the payment was facilitated out of internal cash flow.</p>
<p>At 10.40 a.m. (2340 GMT), FAI shares were steady at 71 cents.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
